<p>New for the site, from the September 2023 notice: the tract is carried as two tax parcels, and the deed reference is Book 1275, Page 229. The source analyst opened the Burke County tax-sale notices for the 2024, 2025 and 2026 seasons (31 weekly posts) and found no Abebe entity, 249 Milton address or site parcel number in them.</p>

<p>Another published notice: The True Citizen printed on January 18, 2023 a court-ordered notice that an electric cooperative petitioned for a 0.24-acre easement on the 187.64-acre tract. It names "ABEBE VENTURES, LLC" among the condemnees, with "Civil Action File No. 2023V0002", filed January 6, 2023. The outcome was not read.</p>

